 "question": "gvyslzh at a higher price of y risk: does DKKM turn more of the interaction room into gap?",
 "notes": "WHY (2026-11-04). gvyslzh had room 27% (0.25-0.34 Sharpe a seed) but a fair gap of only +0.018 (2/10 seeds at +0.029): DKKM converts about 7% of the room. gamma_v 2.5 -> 4 raises the premium per unit exposure by 1.6x, so the interaction's Sharpe rises against estimation noise; the economy is otherwise gvyslzh's.\n\nPRECOMMITMENT STATUS: precommitted=false; ids filled from the Quest build log by the solve script before any seed runs.\n\nPREDICTION (2026-11-04): room 30% or more and a fair gap at or above +0.029. FALSIFIED if the fair gap is at or below +0.01 on three seeds.",
